WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.275
Reading the findings is where
the rules become concrete.

2
00:00:03.275 --> 00:00:07.027
One web server account is trusted
for unconstrained delegation,

3
00:00:07.027 --> 00:00:11.613
which stops working after a delegated
migration, so that conversion is blocked.

4
00:00:11.613 --> 00:00:15.946
Another account's reviewed retrievers
add a server that Active Directory

5
00:00:15.946 --> 00:00:19.650
doesn't have yet, and its end date
runs past the program's deadline.

6
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.491
An intranet account has no
owner and an end date years out,

7
00:00:23.491 --> 00:00:25.125
so it can't be reconciled.

8
00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.150
One sits in Domain Admins.

9
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.367
Meanwhile the plan completes a
migration that started forty days ago,

10
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:33.530
and creates two new group accounts.
